Error [jet.InvalidIndexType]: `Grid` can be read with `[ ]` but not written — it has no `IndexMut` impl
  --> tests/ui/index_hook_ignores_user_trait_named_indexmut.jet:24:6
    |
 24 |     g[1] = 9
    |      ^^^
 Why: Bracket assignment needs `impl Type.IndexMut { set: fn(&self, k, v) }` with the write-access marker `&`
 Fix: Use `.set(key, value)` instead, or add `impl Grid.IndexMut`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0505
